rest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.154424,38.252834]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"cultural_facilities","name":"立木体育館","category":"public","address":"大字立木300","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06323","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"朝日町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.084732,38.301973]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"緑が丘公園","category":"nature","address":"西村山郡朝日町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06323","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"朝日町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.15270332,38.3059444]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"緑町公園","category":"nature","address":"西村山郡朝日町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06323","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"朝日町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.15180131,38.29886252]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"浮島大沼","category":"nature","address":"湖沼景観 / 湖沼","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06323","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"朝日町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"701"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.11228942871094,38.332515716552734]}}],"display_comment_original":"朝日町周辺には、近世村の記憶として中郷村、末吉良村、東助巻村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、鳥屋ヶ森館跡、大隅遺跡、立木鉱山跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、中郷村、末吉良村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["西沢定吉","増田孝介"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["朝日連峰（磐梯朝日国立公園）","日本の棚田百選「椹平（くぬぎだいら）」","大沼の浮島（国の名勝）","佐竹家住宅（国の重要文化財）","若宮寺鐘楼堂（町指定文化財）","五百川三十三観音","水口十一面観音堂","馬神ため池と大谷の郷"],"specialties":["りんご、ブドウ、アケビ","朝日町ワイン","ダチョウ肉","蜜ろうそく","凍みもち"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9C%9D%E6%97%A5%E7%94%BA_%28%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E7%9C%8C%29","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17210666","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11429309"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"朝日町 (山形県)","wikipedia_revision_id":"110157888","wikidata_qid":"Q1347249","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9C%9D%E6%97%A5%E7%94%BA_%28%E5%B1%B1%E5%BD%A2%E7%9C%8C%29","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}